*SE-LO-AD,,177777
*END
*SET-PAGE-TABLE 2
*CLEAR-SEGMENT TCPS0B1

SEGMENT NAME NOT DEFINED
*Y
*DELETE-SEGMENT-NAME TCPS0B1

SEGMENT NAME NOT DEFINED
*NEW-SEGMENT TCPS0B1,,,,,,,,
NEW SEGMENT NO:   147
*READ-BI (TCP-IP)TCP-SER-B1-D02:BPUN,,,,
*SE-LO-AD,,177777
*END
*SET-PAGE-TABLE 2
*CLEAR-SEGMENT TCPS0B2

SEGMENT NAME NOT DEFINED
*Y
*DELETE-SEGMENT-NAME TCPS0B2

SEGMENT NAME NOT DEFINED
*NEW-SEGMENT TCPS0B2,,,,,,,,
NEW SEGMENT NO:   150
*READ-BI (TCP-IP)TCP-SER-B2-D02:BPUN,,,,
*SE-LO-AD,,177777
*END
*SET-PAGE-TABLE 2
*CLEAR-SEGMENT TCPS0B3

SEGMENT NAME NOT DEFINED
*Y
*DELETE-SEGMENT-NAME TCPS0B3

SEGMENT NAME NOT DEFINED
*NEW-SEGMENT TCPS0B3,,,,,,,,
NEW SEGMENT NO:   151
