@cc -------------------

@cc set tcpdevice to n:

@cc  0= 0B,  1= 1B,  2= 2B,  3= 3B.

@cc -4=177774B sets tcpdevice to the lowest numbered ACTIVE eth-II !!

@cc -------------------

@cc set tcpdevice to -4:

@cc @LOOK-AT SEGMENT FTPS0

@cc 24/177774

@cc .

@MODE (TCP-IP)DEFINE-TCPP-D02:MODE,,

