@CC %-------------------------------------------------------%


@DMAC


* DMAC-1915G *

JULY 22, 1988


)RESSM
)CLEAR
)CLOAD S3PATCH
176000/106775  SSTAR
)SYSDF
)9ASSM SYMBOL-1-LIST
 **** 000000 DIAGNOSTICS **** 

?



